{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03457",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 8.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Doctor, I've checked them in and done the preliminary measurements, I'll hand them over when you ask."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.28,
      "end_seconds": 14.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.21,
      "end_seconds": 21.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Yeah, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.49,
      "end_seconds": 27.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 29.18,
      "end_seconds": 34.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "We came because of a high sugar test in pregnancy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.58,
      "end_seconds": 41.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Okay, what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.63,
      "end_seconds": 46.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 47.57,
      "end_seconds": 57.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the lansoprazole was 60 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.09,
      "end_seconds": 63.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Right, hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.28,
      "end_seconds": 68.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Uh, not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.02,
      "end_seconds": 79.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.15,
      "end_seconds": 88.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.85,
      "end_seconds": 103.56,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "For my bones, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.54,
      "end_seconds": 122.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.2,
      "end_seconds": 126.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Around a week, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 127.24,
      "end_seconds": 130.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Hm, I'd say more like two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.68,
      "end_seconds": 136.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.83,
      "end_seconds": 138.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.4,
      "end_seconds": 143.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.08,
      "end_seconds": 152.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.49,
      "end_seconds": 159.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.53,
      "end_seconds": 162.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.11,
      "end_seconds": 169.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 169.63,
      "end_seconds": 175.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "Hmm, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.95,
      "end_seconds": 179.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.57,
      "end_seconds": 184.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Any a big baby on the scan as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.59,
      "end_seconds": 188.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Yeah. Two weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.42,
      "end_seconds": 197.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Have you had a high sugar test in pregnancy before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.2,
      "end_seconds": 205.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 207.14,
      "end_seconds": 209.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.47,
      "end_seconds": 216.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "And what about passing a lot of urine, blurred vision or thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.78,
      "end_seconds": 235.81,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "No, no passing a lot of urine, no blurred vision, no thirst. I did have no symptoms at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.61,
      "end_seconds": 241.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Any reduced baby movements?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Nope, no reduced baby movements."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.0,
      "end_seconds": 250.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.21,
      "end_seconds": 253.12,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.16,
      "end_seconds": 258.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Alright, how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.03,
      "end_seconds": 266.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.22,
      "end_seconds": 271.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.01,
      "end_seconds": 281.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.93,
      "end_seconds": 283.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.14,
      "end_seconds": 285.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.68,
      "end_seconds": 289.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.66,
      "end_seconds": 296.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees, yes. I have depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.88,
      "end_seconds": 298.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.55,
      "end_seconds": 305.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.04,
      "end_seconds": 309.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.95,
      "end_seconds": 316.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.21,
      "end_seconds": 323.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.75,
      "end_seconds": 327.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.87,
      "end_seconds": 331.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.95,
      "end_seconds": 338.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.63,
      "end_seconds": 346.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.04,
      "end_seconds": 352.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 353.23,
      "end_seconds": 365.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse is 65 beats a minute, weight 71 kilos, height 168 centimetres. BP is 120 over 81, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.54,
      "end_seconds": 367.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.22,
      "end_seconds": 373.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.15,
      "end_seconds": 376.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.93,
      "end_seconds": 392.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and your urine has no sugar today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.88,
      "end_seconds": 399.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.96,
      "end_seconds": 426.42,
      "duration_seconds": 18.46,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is gestational diabetes controllable with diet. Just to be sure I understood. You've had a high sugar test in pregnancy, severe, and no reduced baby movements or thirst."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.05,
      "end_seconds": 428.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.67,
      "end_seconds": 444.24,
      "duration_seconds": 13.57,
      "text": "We should do a glucose meter and diary for gestational diabetes. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.12,
      "end_seconds": 447.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.97,
      "end_seconds": 456.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Let's plan a check in two weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 458.11,
      "end_seconds": 461.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}